#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Synthetic per-feature probes through dropdump (the tree's own LibCSS).
One case per process so the report cannot desync. Prints verdict per case:
  ACCEPTED / DROP-DECL(unknown-prop|bad-value|trailing) / RULE-REFUSED / AT-RULE-LOST / SILENT(no report)."""
